flowchart LR
    A[Observe service health] --> B{SLO or control breach?}
    B -- No --> C[Continue normal operations]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D[Classify severity and blast radius]
    D --> E[Assign incident command]
    E --> F[Contain and stabilize]
    F --> G[Recover service]
    G --> H[Verify business and technical health]
    H --> I[Close incident]
    I --> J[Post-incident review]
    J --> K[Problem record and corrective actions]
    K --> L[Change, automate or redesign]
    L --> M[Validate in controlled deployment]
    M --> A

    N[Change request] --> O[Risk and reversibility assessment]
    O --> P{Approved class?}
    P -- No --> Q[Reject or redesign]
    P -- Yes --> R[Deploy progressively]
    R --> S[Post-deployment verification]
    S --> A

    T[Continuity exercise] --> U[Test people, permissions, data and dependencies]
    U --> V[Record gaps and actions]
    V --> K
